Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.88,0:00:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see how it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.29,0:00:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't kill any of these guys, Fran.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.88,0:00:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? If you say so.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.96,0:00:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw crap!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.88,0:00:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's too strong!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.50,0:00:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hah! You've got real guts, missy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.21,0:00:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't matter, me and my crew have sunk\Nhundreds of ships and you'll be the nex-
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.38,0:00:33.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Captain!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.13,0:00:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Surrender now.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unless you want your boss here to lose all her limbs.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.88,0:00:46.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! They're not really pirates,\Njust fishers from the Seedrun Kingdom?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.42,0:00:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. All of their skills\Nare stuff like "Cast" and "Hook."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.04,0:00:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our tax rates went through the roof\Nafter the new king took the throne.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,None of us could afford 'em.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.46,0:00:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, they fled the kingdom and became pirates instead?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.58,0:01:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've heard rumblings about a change\Nin leadership causing some strife,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.29,0:01:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I didn't realize it was quite so bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.38,0:01:09.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Princess Sellimea always stood up\Nfor us regular folk, but she's gone missing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.33,0:01:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Word is the bastards had her assassinated.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seedrun is as good as doomed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Sellimea"?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.88,0:01:21.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,For now, let's set course for their pirate fort.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.46,0:01:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need to repair and resupply, if we can.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.38,0:01:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Suit yourselves!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.67,0:01:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that meat?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm! Yummy meat!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.46,0:01:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hardly enough here for a proper resupply, Cap'n.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.46,0:01:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, that means our only option is to sail for Seedrun.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.17,0:01:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.13,0:01:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Captain! Ship approaching from north-northwest!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.04,0:01:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.29,0:01:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's a battleship from the Seedrun Kingdom!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.42,0:01:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.79,0:01:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,All hands at the ready! Be prepared to leave post-haste!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.17,0:01:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Be careful. We can't make any moves\Nthat could be seen as aggressive.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yep. I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.67,0:02:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,First pirates, now a battleship?\NI've got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.75,0:03:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,My name is Dwight.\NI am the admiral of the Seedrun Navy.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,All of you no-good pirates are under arrest!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, sir, but we are no pirates!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.79,0:03:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's rich coming from a bunch of ruffians
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,using a well-known pirate dock.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.50,0:04:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're sailors from the Phyllius Kingdom.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.13,0:04:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We even have a port permit for entry to Seedrun!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. I'm sure it's just a cheap forgery.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.92,0:04:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can have you put to death\Nfor resisting arrest, you know!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.46,0:04:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, be reasonable!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.63,0:04:14.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.46,0:04:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.75,0:04:18.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We are members of the Phyllius royal family.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.25,0:04:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our people are not pirates.\NWe are happy to show you proof of our status.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.96,0:04:28.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I suggest you watch your attitude, or this could quickly\Nbecome a diplomatic problem for both nations.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.42,0:04:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really now?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.92,0:04:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our diplomatic relationship with Phyllius was canned\Nafter the new king took the throne.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.71,0:04:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn't even matter if I buy\Nyour hogwash about being royalty,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.50,0:04:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,because you're still guilty of trespassing on our territory!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.88,0:04:45.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is absurd.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm? Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.58,0:04:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We were forced to land here due to an emergency.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.71,0:04:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you could see fit to offer us your aid, then I guarantee\Nthe Lucille Trade Association will reward you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.58,0:04:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.63,0:04:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hush money, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.08,0:04:58.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.29,0:05:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Trying to bribe the honorable admiral\Nof the Seedrun Kingdom is a truly foolish move.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Another crime to put on your rap sheet!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.46,0:05:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-hold on, sir! I was merely saying\Nyou would receive a reward of good will!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.71,0:05:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Capture them!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.58,0:05:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This lard bucket is just looking\Nfor any excuse to take us captive.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.08,0:05:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come here, brat!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.71,0:05:27.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You knave! Get your hands off the Prince!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.88,0:05:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.88,0:05:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,How'd he do that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.42,0:05:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make one false move and I'll lop your head off\Nalong with the two royals.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.38,0:05:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.50,0:05:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, damn. Advanced Sword Mastery?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,This guy could be serious trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.25,0:05:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We pack the bigger punch,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,but he's got experience out the wazoo.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't even have a chance to react!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.54,0:06:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't pick a fight with this guy, Fran.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.13,0:06:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're looking at Valuza the Black Fang,\Nleader of the Dragon Fang Knights.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.92,0:06:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,He can make mincemeat\Nof C-rank adventurers with ease!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.13,0:06:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Valuza...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.71,0:06:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.75,0:06:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have no decency, Valuza?!\NYou didn't need to kill her so mercilessly!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.17,0:06:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The admiral warned you\Nthat resisting arrest would be met with death.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.63,0:06:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you've made your point!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.67,0:06:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We will go with you quietly, so please no more violence!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.63,0:06:35.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.58,0:06:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please go easy on the children.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.71,0:06:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Throw the whole lot in the brig, men!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What about the body, sir?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.46,0:06:49.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Just feed it to the hunting dogs or something.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.96,0:07:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let us out! C'mon!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.25,0:07:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't treat us like criminals!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.00,0:07:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is outrageous!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.79,0:07:07.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Open the cell, dammit!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.75,0:07:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't ignore us!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.88,0:07:13.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Killing one of the royal guard is a crime!\NYou won't get away with it!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pipe down.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.00,0:07:22.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Any warrior worth their salt knows\Nthat drawing a blade is an open invitation to death.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.58,0:07:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those without the skills to defend themselves die.\NThat's just how it goes.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.25,0:07:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm heading back to the palace.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.71,0:07:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yessir!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.08,0:07:42.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,This sucks. What's gonna happen to us?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me, man.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.29,0:07:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, Fran...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.46,0:07:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll keep you all safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fran. You okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.88,0:07:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Teacher!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.38,0:07:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Awesome! Seems you're still registered as my wielder.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.67,0:07:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sit tight, I'm coming to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.38,0:07:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,'Kay! I'll be here!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Transmogrify!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.50,0:08:04.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is someone in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.29,0:08:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sneak, sneak, sneak...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.71,0:08:12.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whew... This really takes a toll on my MP.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sneak, sneak, sneak...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.29,0:08:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sneak, sneak, sneak...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.21,0:08:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sneak, sneak, sneak...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ew, a bug.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.79,0:08:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Die, bug!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.42,0:08:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,NO, WAIT! IT'S ME!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.58,0:08:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Die, bug!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.04,0:08:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Teacher?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.04,0:08:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yep, I made it back.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, teeny Teacher!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.42,0:08:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I can't keep this form for very long.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice thinking, Jet!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.54,0:08:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've got company.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you lot are in luck.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.46,0:08:49.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've reached an agreement.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.75,0:08:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.71,0:08:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It sounds like Prince Fult\Nand Princess Satya came through for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.13,0:08:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who among you belong to Salut's knight brigade?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.25,0:09:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, we do, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.50,0:09:03.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take them away and leave the rest.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.92,0:09:05.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why, Sir Dwight?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.75,0:09:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aren't we getting released with them?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.13,0:09:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,They sold the rest of you out!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.92,0:09:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.67,0:09:18.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The deal is the Phyllius royals and their guards go free,\Nwhile the rest of you become slaves!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Prince and Princess kept whining,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.83,0:09:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,"We don't care what happens to the others,\Njust let our people go back home! Wah-wah-wah!"
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,So congrats!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.29,0:09:33.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You get to start new lives as slaves tomorrow!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.67,0:09:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll be lower than livestock. Better learn to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.17,0:09:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Fult and Satya would never leave us behind.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.25,0:09:47.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good call, Fran. I just checked\Nwith Essence of Falsehood.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.25,0:09:51.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dwight's a lying pig for sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.83,0:09:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the part about turning you all into slaves was legit.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.25,0:09:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need to organize a jail break tonight.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.79,0:09:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should we cut the bars off?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.08,0:10:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, the guards would notice.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.33,0:10:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, it's risky leading such a big group\Naround unknown territory.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.83,0:10:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Time for the shift change alre-
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.88,0:10:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.58,0:10:28.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you've got ties with the Phyllius Kingdom, yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.46,0:10:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Possible creep alert. Time for Identify!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.42,0:10:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, those are some D-rank stats.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the-?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.71,0:10:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold the phone!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.29,0:10:42.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,My name is Miriam Seedrun.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she a good guy, Teacher?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.21,0:10:45.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.96,0:10:48.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I can tell you that she's the Princess of this kingdom.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm getting you out of here. Follow me.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.58,0:10:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you saving us?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.25,0:11:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because that's what my ruler has ordered.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.00,0:11:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're armed?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.29,0:11:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her ruler? Go higher than a princess\Nand you get the king, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who's your ruler?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.67,0:11:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Confidential.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.38,0:11:09.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The King?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.21,0:11:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what?! You must be crazy!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.92,0:11:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would never serve under that fathead brother of mine!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.79,0:11:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then who?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.17,0:11:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,My loyalty belongs to my sister, Princess Sellimea.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.00,0:11:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, she coughed up that detail pretty quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.38,0:11:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Sellimea?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've heard that name before!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But she's supposed to be dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.58,0:11:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's just fake news my fathead brother Suarez\Nhas been spreading around.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.67,0:11:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Suarez?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.42,0:11:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's the reigning King.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.08,0:11:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeesh. This kingdom sounds like a real mess.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.58,0:11:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,In any case...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.96,0:11:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miriam hasn't been lying to us so far.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.13,0:11:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right. You have my trust.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.25,0:11:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That makes it easy for us. We follow Miss Fran's lead.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.21,0:11:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great. Then let's make this quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are too many soldiers above ground.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So we'll go under them to get out.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.88,0:12:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a secret underground passage!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't think those were a real thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is so cool to see!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.88,0:12:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay, we're outside!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.83,0:12:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shush! Don't be so loud.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.25,0:12:25.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.92,0:12:28.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Carla. Did you take care of the other exits?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, I left them ajar.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.04,0:12:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I also made sure to plant evidence\Nthat a large group of people passed through.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.88,0:12:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, they've got their bases covered.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.42,0:12:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,They anticipated we might get pursued\Nand left fake tracks at other exits to sow confusion.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.67,0:12:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Please board the wagons, everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.17,0:12:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're in some kind of slum.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.96,0:12:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is the princess really staying here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.96,0:12:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.29,0:12:59.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.13,0:13:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Psst.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.79,0:13:09.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency safe house\Nthat the previous King had made.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Suarez doesn't know about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.58,0:13:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hoo boy! Secret underground passage part 2!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.38,0:13:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're going to meet with our ruler now.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.13,0:13:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,However, we can't accommodate all of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.63,0:13:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The girlie and-
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.50,0:13:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have a name. It's Fran.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.46,0:13:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fran, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.04,0:13:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're pretty darn strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.67,0:13:31.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She just used her Strength Sense skill.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to have you on our side.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.21,0:13:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You come along, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.71,0:13:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone else can just sit tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.58,0:13:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's a reason we freed you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.38,0:13:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Phyllius royal twins\Nare in a very precarious situation right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.29,0:14:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. I have returned.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.33,0:14:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miriam! I'm relieved you're okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.25,0:14:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I only went to sneak into the prison\Nunder the cover of night. There was no real danger.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.71,0:14:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, you've always had a rowdy streak.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.46,0:14:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like all those times you picked fights\Nwith the palace guards,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.04,0:14:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,or tried to ride broncos and got sent flying, you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.29,0:14:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh please, Your Majesty! Don't bring that up!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It happened forever ago!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.04,0:14:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oops. Force of habit.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.58,0:14:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,My apologies, dear visitors.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.21,0:14:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No biggie.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.33,0:14:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran, that's no way to address royalty.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.58,0:14:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.33,0:14:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should introduce myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.63,0:14:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am Sellimea Vellmelio Seedrun,\Ncrown Princess of the Seedrun Kingdom.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.88,0:14:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Fran, an adventurer.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.42,0:14:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I came here as Fult and Satya's bodyguard.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.08,0:14:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fran is quite formidable, Your Majesty.\NShe's even stronger than I am.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.58,0:14:59.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Goodness me. That's very impressive,\Ngiven how young you look!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.54,0:15:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I captain a private ship as a member\Nof the Lucille Trade Association. My name is Rengill.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I understand you've had a rough time here.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.46,0:15:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard the twins are in trouble, so I wanna save them.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.92,0:15:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.83,0:15:15.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Before we get into the nitty-gritty,\Nlet's bring the rest of your group inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.42,0:15:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Carla.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.42,0:15:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.63,0:15:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, how much do you know about\Nwhat's happening in our kingdom?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.54,0:15:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You got a new King who's dumb as bricks\Nand now everybody's having a bad time.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.63,0:15:30.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a good summary.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,How'd you end up with such a dumb King?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.17,0:15:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hate say it, but Suarez wields a lot of power.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.42,0:15:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does having lots of power make it easy to be King?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.17,0:15:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, Seedrun was originally founded\Nby a group of pirates who sailed these waters
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.42,0:15:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and used to wreak a lot of havoc.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.33,0:15:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Most of our citizens are descended from those pirates,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.54,0:15:52.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,which has created a national culture\Nwhere power is exalted above all else.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.54,0:15:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the members of the military\Nhold the most influence here
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.92,0:16:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,and Suarez took the throne\Nbecause he had the majority of their support.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.17,0:16:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Suarez conducted a total purge\Nof the people who took issue with him.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.58,0:16:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then he imposed heavy taxes on the people\Nand cut the budgets for social services,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.54,0:16:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,using it all to bolster the military instead.\NNow our kingdom is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.79,0:16:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, in a nutshell,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.00,0:16:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miriam and Sellimea's idiot brother Suarez\Ntook the throne and became a ruthless tyrant.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.83,0:16:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And now, these two are trying to fight back against him.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.88,0:16:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fran?! Uh-oh, all these complicated details\Nare about to short circuit her little brain!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.71,0:16:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, our uncle Julius\Nwho used to serve as commander-in-chief
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.13,0:16:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,has flipped his support to Suarez.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.58,0:16:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold up, "Julius"?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.54,0:16:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fran! Show them those documents we found!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.33,0:16:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have something to show you.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.63,0:16:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are documents I found at the hideout\Nof some black market slavers in Dars.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.33,0:16:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,My God, Uncle Julius and Suarez\Nhave been taking bribes from slavers?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.92,0:17:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are contracts to turn the impoverished people\Nof our kingdom into slaves!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.96,0:17:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's all part of a plan to ship them\Nto the Raydoss Kingdom, apparently.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.46,0:17:09.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Officials from Raydoss have been engaged\Nin talks with my brother lately.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.38,0:17:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I suspect they want to seize control\Nof the Serpent Fleet from us.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.92,0:17:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Serpent Fleet?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.42,0:17:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom's secret weapon.\NFour battleships that you won't find anywhere else.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.63,0:17:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow! A secret weapon!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.04,0:17:25.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The name "Serpent" is quite literal.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.42,0:17:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're giant battleships that are hauled\Nby Sea Serpents, a B-rank monster.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.33,0:17:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,They can sail three times faster than normal ships
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.42,0:17:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,and can sink almost any vessel instantly\Nby using the power of the Sea Serpent.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.67,0:17:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Threat Rank B?! Those monsters are strong enough\Nto wipe whole cities off the map!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.54,0:17:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,And they have four of them?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.42,0:17:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Serpent Fleet! So cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.00,0:17:46.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.67,0:17:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Control of the ships is divided:\None for Suarez, one for Julius,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.21,0:17:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,one for our cousin Gladio,\Nand the last belongs to Sellimea.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.63,0:17:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Sea Serpents only heed orders\Nfrom those with the blood of the first King
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.71,0:18:01.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,who have been registered as their masters.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.58,0:18:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, my dear Warnate! I hope she's not too lonely.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.08,0:18:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sellimea's ship is stuck docked at the palace,\Nin a port reserved for the Serpent Fleet.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.00,0:18:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess that means using it is out of the question, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.38,0:18:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, we get to the crux of the issue.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.38,0:18:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,My dumbass brother is trying to forge an alliance\Nwith the Raydossians.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.63,0:18:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,An alliance...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.33,0:18:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Worse yet, it seems the Raydoss Kingdom\Nwants control of the Serpent Fleet in return.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.38,0:18:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that's one demand that my brother\Nwould never agree to.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.13,0:18:37.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So negotiations were at a standstill,\Nuntil the Phyllius royal twins showed up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.67,0:18:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Phyllius Kingdom is small, but they\Nhave a history of fending off Raydossian invasions.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.96,0:18:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's thanks to the power\Nof their Godsword, known as "Diablos."
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.63,0:18:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aha! Godsword mentioned!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.75,0:18:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What kind of sword is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.71,0:18:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Members of the Phyllius royal family\Nhave a pact with the Godsword,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.25,0:19:00.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,which gives them the power of literal demons.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.29,0:19:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or so rumor has it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.17,0:19:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Demons... whoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.58,0:19:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Offering Raydoss the chance to undermine\None of their biggest threats
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.96,0:19:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,could convince them to give up on the Serpent Fleet.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.58,0:19:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, they're giving Fult and Satya\Nto Raydoss as bargaining chips.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.75,0:19:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Seedrun makes a deal with\Na scummy kingdom like Raydoss,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.04,0:19:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,they're just going to strip our power away\Nuntil they colonize us!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.17,0:19:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We must stop that from happening at any cost.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.29,0:19:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, basically, we're all after the same thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.08,0:19:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fran. I ask that you please help us rescue\Nthe Phyllius royal twins.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.50,0:19:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't even need to ask.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.21,0:19:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's my job to keep Fult and Satya safe!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.13,0:19:42.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.46,0:19:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll be glad to know, we've actually made contact\Nwith one of their people, Sir Salut.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.96,0:19:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! That dark knight dude!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.29,0:19:50.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We make our move tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.54,0:19:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The plan is to infiltrate the royal villa\Nwhere the twins are being held and rescue them.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.92,0:20:08.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a good chance to practice some of those skills\Nthat System Lady cooked up for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.50,0:20:07.75,Q7,,0,0,0,,Yay, I win again!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.75,0:20:09.08,Q7,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.50,0:20:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,First up, the one that came from combining\Nall my wind-based skills: Wind Manipulation!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.13,0:20:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me compress some air...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.46,0:20:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.46,0:20:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.08,0:20:25.79,Q7,,0,0,0,,Checkmate!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.08,0:20:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once I get a handle on this,\NI'm sure it'll prove useful somehow.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.50,Q7,,0,0,0,,You need to think a little harder, Fran.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.58,0:20:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And drain less of my mana, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.38,0:20:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Carla, Vyke.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.38,0:20:35.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is it looking?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.88,0:20:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,All good so far. The decoy squad\Nhas attacked the port as planned,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.83,0:20:42.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,which diverted most of the soldiers\Nwho were on guard duty.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.08,0:20:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This gives us a chance to meet\Nwith the Prince and Princess inside the villa,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.33,0:20:47.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,so we can help them to escape.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,One of Sir Salut's men should be here soon...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.50,0:20:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting! I'm Yorth, from Phyllius.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm here to take you to Sir Salut.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.21,0:21:01.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran! Glad to see you're okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.00,0:21:03.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.33,0:21:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can tell she doesn't remember this guy at all...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.63,0:21:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm falling!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.33,0:21:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm slipping!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.33,0:21:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shucks, I'm sorry that he dragged you down.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.92,0:21:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No prob. I expected as much.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.96,0:21:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, that's just mean!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must be Sir Salut.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.79,0:21:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Miriam, I presume?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.42,0:21:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,As I explained before, Prince Fult\Nand Princess Satya aren't physically restrained,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.17,0:21:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,but have been kept from leaving the villa.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.08,0:21:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you take these guys out, Salut?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.17,0:21:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just put them asleep with dark magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.42,0:21:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know I haven't been the most reliable so far,\Nbut this is where I'm gonna shine!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.67,0:21:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fran!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.71,0:21:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop! Get back!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.25,0:21:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.25,0:21:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But nobody's in he-
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.08,0:21:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yorth!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I erased my presence and yet you still noticed me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.58,0:21:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This bastard again.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.46,0:21:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know him...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Valuza the Black Fang!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.88,0:22:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fancy seeing you again.
